  "prefLabel": "Adm 1002.05 Expenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1002.05 \"Expenses\" means the expenses of service of process to compel the attendance of witnesses and other expenses necessary for an adequate defense against criminal charges or charges of juvenile delinquency.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #9149, eff 5-1-08 (from Adm 1002.04); ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by 13050, eff 7-1-20 (formerly Adm 1002.04)",
